+RE or the beginning of a parenthesized subexpression
+(after a possible leading
+.Sq ^ ) .
+.It
+Finally, there is one new type of atom, a
+.Em back-reference :
+.Sq \e
+followed by a non-zero decimal digit
+.Ar d
